# HireDesk Frontend Environment Variables

# The base URL of the backend API.
# In local development:
#   Leave as /api to use the Vite dev server proxy (which proxies /api to http://localhost:4000).
# In production (e.g. hosted on Vercel, Netlify, Render):
#   Set to your full deployed backend API URL, e.g. https://your-backend.onrender.com/api
VITE_API_URL=/api
